// does not have Inter. Use it with the mark in `app-logo-shape.ts`, as the brand page does.
//
// The outlines are "Builders" in Inter Light (300) and "Bot" in Inter Medium (500), with the space of
// Inter Light between them, set with the font's kerning. They were drawn from the variable Inter that
// `@fontsource-variable/inter` ships (`inter-latin-wght-normal.woff2`). To change them, draw them
// again from the font: do not edit the numbers by hand.

